Chief...

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.350
Chiikorin hasn't arrived yet...

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.290
Chiikorin?

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.290
Yes, Chiikorin...

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:51.880
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.180
sono ashiwo tomenna
